2026-11-06T03:01:27.8835124Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8835581Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8835995Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8836441Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8837729Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8840126Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8840532Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8841245Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8842406Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8852422Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8853320Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:01:27.8853859Z 
